questions.code:
REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY daily_sales;
-- ERROR: cannot refresh materialized view "public.daily_sales" concurrently
-- HINT: Create a unique index with no WHERE clause on one or more columns of the materialized view.

questions.answer:
CONCURRENTLY needs a unique index (not partial) on the materialized view so PostgreSQL can match old and new rows.
```sql
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX daily_sales_day_uidx ON daily_sales (day);
REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY daily_sales;
```
